==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The actual prerequisite is not the ability to cast level 9 spells, but being an [[epic class|epic]] [[cleric]], [[druid]], [[sorcerer]], or [[wizard]], or having at least 15 [[pale master]] levels. Furthermore, this feat can only be chosen when gaining a level in the qualifying class.
*As with all epic spells, this feat can be used once per day.

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.

